      "text": "let's book a wound swab to look into wound infection. Let's use flucloxacillin 500 milligrams four times a day seven days. You take it by mouth. That's for wound infection. Keep it clean and dry and use fresh dressings daily. Let's plan a check in two days. Right that's all from me. Any questions?"
